Third-party components
----------------------

`@thisismydesign/cursor-canvas-web` - https://github.com/thisismydesign/cursor-canvas-web
  MIT License, Copyright (c) 2026 thisismydesign
  The public, Mantine-backed shim of Cursor's virtual `cursor/canvas` module.
  This project depends on it; it is not vendored. Its full license text ships
  in `node_modules/@thisismydesign/cursor-canvas-web/LICENSE`.

  `src/cursor-canvas.compat.mjs` re-exports that shim and wraps `useHostTheme()`
  to add a `category` token group the public shim omits. The wrapper is covered
  by this project's MIT license; the shim itself remains under its own MIT
  license, reproduced above and in its own LICENSE file.

Other dependencies (React, Mantine, esbuild, Electron, Recharts) are used under
their own permissive licenses; see each package's LICENSE file.
